  description: 'If you Normal or Special Summon a non-Token Normal Monster(s) (except
    during the Damage Step): You can draw 1 card. When an attack is declared involving
    an opponent''s monster and a monster you control that is a Level 5 or higher
    Normal Monster, or was Ritual Summoned using a Normal Monster, or was Fusion,
    Synchro, or Xyz Summoned using a Normal Monster as material: You can make that
    monster you control gain ATK equal to that opponent''s monster''s ATK, until
    the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of "Piercing the Darkness"
    once per turn.'
